Type: Project
Package: brutingcalls
Title: BirdNET Call Detection, Verification and Reporting for Demeter Recordings
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: person("Abhimanyu Raj", "Singh", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shiny app that runs BirdNET on passive acoustic recordings, supports human
    verification of low-confidence detections and reports species, call counts, timing,
    durations, intervals and frequency. Part of the Demeter Insights apps.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: R (>= 4.3)
Imports: shiny, bslib, ggplot2, dplyr, DT, jsonlite, processx, htmltools, sessioninfo
SystemRequirements: Python (>= 3.10) with the packages in requirements.txt
Encoding: UTF-8
